    "created_at": "2017-09-12T21:30:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-09-12T21:30:04Z",
    "body": "Also, you're explicitly *not* supposed to use type=number for telephone numbers...\r\n\r\nGiven that misconception, I think it's best we close this, since we don't have any use case presented. Happy to continue discussing in the closed thread though, and reopen if a use case is presented that shows evidence of addressing the linked bug's concerns.",
